# ============================================================================
# .gitignore - Ca-Sr-O repository
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALLOWLIST strategy: everything is ignored by default and files are un-ignored
# one by one. This is deliberate: it prevents committing files that are not
# part of the database or code.
#
# To add a file to the repo: write its !rule below.
# ============================================================================

# Ignore everything, including the contents of any subfolder
*
*/

# --- Repository documentation ------------------------------------------------
!README.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE-DATA.md
!CITATION.cff
!.gitignore

# --- The database ------------------------------------------------------------
!CaSrO.TDB
!CaSrO_opt.tdb
!CaSrO_opt_liq.tdb

# --- Thermo-Calc macros (they reproduce the work) ----------------------------
!validar_CaSrO.TCM
!optimizar_CaSrO_PARROT.TCM
!diagrama_CaSrO_opt.TCM
!comparar_experimental.TCM
!CaSrO.POP

# --- Experimental data taken from the literature -----------------------------
# Measured points with their citation: publishable. The articles they come
# from are not.
!ca_o_liquidus_solubility.csv
!halite_tielines_1100K.csv
!datos_experimentales_parrot.md
# Digitized by hand from the paper figures, provenance given in the header
!experimental_CaSrO.EXP

# --- Own diagrams exported from Console Mode (DATAPLOT format) ---------------
# Output of calculations made with this same database: these are results, not
# experimental data. The two configurations of README section 7.
!dos.exp
!diagrama tc.exp

# --- Validation figures ------------------------------------------------------
# Only the ones that put the model against experimental data. The parameter
# sensitivity studies and the mechanism sketches stay out, along with the
# Python that generated all of them.
!diagrama_CaSrO_completo.png
!diagrama_CaSrO_optimizado.png
!resultado_optimizacion_CaSrO.png

# --- Tabulated results -------------------------------------------------------
!diagrama_CaSrO.csv
!diagrama_CaSrO_completo.csv


